# Copy this file to secrets.properties (repo root) and fill in real values.
# secrets.properties is gitignored — never commit real API keys.
#
# Consumed by androidApp/build.gradle.kts, which injects MAPS_API_KEY into the
# AndroidManifest.xml placeholder used by Google Maps. Without a real key here
# (or without this file at all) the app still builds, but the Maps key resolves
# to an empty string and every map screen renders blank.
#
# The same key is also consumed by composeApp/build.gradle.kts (via the BuildKonfig
# plugin, generated as com.juanpablo0612.carpool.core.config.BuildKonfig.MAPS_API_KEY)
# for the Places API (New) autocomplete/details calls and the Geocoding API reverse-
# geocoding calls in data/place/datasource/GooglePlacesSearchService.kt. This means the
# key needs Maps SDK for Android, Places API (New), and Geocoding API all enabled in the
# Google Cloud console — without the latter two, the app still builds, but address
# search and reverse geocoding silently return no results.

MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
